# Data and multi-tenant

- Today: multi-building by name string `edificio`. Target: `buildingId` + `tenantId` (`docs/03-multi-tenant-plan.md`).
- Collections: `users`, `buildings`, `news`, `dashboard`, `zonas`(+`events`), `visits`, `bills`, `complaints`, `votings`.
- Firestore roles: `CLIENTE`, `ADMINISTRADOR`, `SUPERADMINISTRADOR`.
- When typing models: include stable ID fields; building name only as denormalized display if needed.
- Do not assume isolation between buildings/tenants from client-side filters alone.
- `Globals` / asset logo = single-tenant debt; replacement = `tenants/{tenantId}` + centralized session.
- Current FCM topics depend on name; target = stable ID (`buildingId`).
